the equation is $\\text{inhomogeneous}.$\n\n- The boundary conditions are\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}(0)=0,\\,{y}^{′}(2)=-3.\n$$\n\nThese are $\\text{Neumann}$ boundary conditions, and since the right-hand sides are not zero for both, they are $\\text{inhomogeneous}.$\n\n- Since the governing equation is inhomogeneous, and the boundary conditions are inhomogeneous, the BVP is $\\text{inhomogeneous}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14066273/state.json" "file_sha256" "2046f9e8a3a6cc2470714f5345e49ec3f604e541ce3c0d92936e476c9afc277e"} {"question" "q-338715" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14066273/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "74f48968130ab24e59507579f2b41f2de58f412102b9f0d51f0964a9abb1fb03"} {"question" "q-338715" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/select "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14066273/state.json" "file_sha256" "2046f9e8a3a6cc2470714f5345e49ec3f604e541ce3c0d92936e476c9afc277e"} {"question" "q-338715" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "homogeneous"] ["text" "inhomogeneous"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14066273/state.json" "file_sha256" "2046f9e8a3a6cc2470714f5345e49ec3f604e541ce3c0d92936e476c9afc277e"} {"question" "q-338715" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "inhomogeneous"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14066273/state.json" "file_sha256" "2046f9e8a3a6cc2470714f5345e